{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"写的是对亲近关系的担忧和无把握，没有把珠子里的比喻写成真实动作或具体场景，也没有新增前史、人物关系、外部事件、音乐术语或小节号。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S04-1 已确立他怕开口改变相处、又怕迟疑导致亲近流失，S05 对如何留住亲近及其能否长久的无把握可以由此延伸。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能明白他夹在怕开口改变亲近与怕迟疑失去亲近之间，并且对如何维持这份亲近、它能否长久都没有把握。\",\n  \"progress\": \"是\",\n  \"progress_why\": \"这一段从前面已经确立的开口风险和失去亲近的担忧，进一步写到不知道如何留住亲近、也无法确定它能否长久，增加了具体的无措感。\"\n  ,\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S05-1\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"前半两层担忧几乎复述 S04-1 的核心意思，真正新增的是不知道如何留住亲近、无法确定能否长久；可以压缩重复部分，把重点放在这一层新的无措上。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8a5d3e6f-7dca-4597-81d5-5e870e554daf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T053814772276Z", "elapsed_seconds": 110.75, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T05:40:05.525554+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ab6747e74ec1a280dd6987b393e029e7013f55fb876f602ee8b323612f9a0632", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false